### ==============================================================================
### SDCC - APLICACIONES DISTRIBUIDAS (PRUEBAS EXPERIMENTALES P01 - P08)
### Gateway URL: http://localhost:8080
### Eureka URL:  http://localhost:8761
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@eurekaUrl = http://localhost:8761

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P01: Descubrimiento Dinámico - Dashboard & Registry de Eureka
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1.1 Consultar estado del registro de Eureka (Apps registradas)
GET {{eurekaUrl}}/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

###
# 1.2 Healthcheck del Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Consultas previas de Inventario (Servicio B)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Consultar stock de PROD-001 (Laptop Dell)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/PROD-001

###
# Consultar stock de PROD-002 (Monitor LG)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/PROD-002

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P04 & P05: Creación de Pedido (Escritura en PostgreSQL Primary + RPC a Inventario)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4.1 Crear pedido exitoso (valida stock en inventory-service y persiste en PRIMARY)
# @name createOrderSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: sdcc-audit-order

{
  "customerName": "Cliente Demo",
  "customerEmail": "demo@example.invalid",
  "productCode": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 2
}

> {%
client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id);
%}

###
# 4.2 Intentar crear pedido con stock insuficiente (debe responder 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: sdcc-audit-reject

{
  "customerName": "Cliente Sin Stock",
  "customerEmail": "sin-stock@example.invalid",
  "productCode": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 9999
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P07: Consistencia de Lectura Crítica Inmediata (Read-Your-Writes)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Consultar inmediatamente el pedido creado por createOrderSuccess usando su ID real
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
X-Consistency: critical
X-Correlation-Id: sdcc-audit-critical

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### P02, P05, P06, P08: Lecturas Ordinarias Balanceadas entre Réplicas (Round-Robin)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ejecutar consecutivamente para observar la alternancia de X-Database-Node:
# Petición A -> Esperado: REPLICA_1 (y X-Instance-Id: order-service-1 o 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
X-Correlation-Id: sdcc-p05-read-1

###
# Petición B -> Esperado: REPLICA_2 (y X-Instance-Id: order-service-2 o 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
X-Correlation-Id: sdcc-p05-read-2

###
# Petición C -> Esperado: REPLICA_1 (Rotación circular Round-Robin continua)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
X-Correlation-Id: sdcc-p05-read-3

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Pruebas de Resiliencia: Circuit Breaker Fallback
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Probar el fallback controlado del Circuit Breaker si order-service cae
GET {{baseUrl}}/fallback/orders

###
# Probar el fallback controlado del Circuit Breaker si inventory-service cae
GET {{baseUrl}}/fallback/inventory
